+
+// A disc patch: a mod's patch to the game's disc image (VCDIFF, as xdelta3
+// writes it, with or without its LZMA secondary compression), turned once
+// into a layer over the release's image. The layer keeps only the sectors
+// the patch changes; IsoImage reads a layer file as the patched disc, taking
+// every other sector from the release's image. A player then needs neither a
+// patching tool nor a second full image, and the layer stays the size of what
+// the mod changed.
+namespace portablekit::disc_patch {
+
+// True when the file starts as a VCDIFF patch does.
